## 2. AI Agent Reading Order

### Phase 1: Understand (Read before any action)
| Order | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | `Save_Token.mdc` | Communication protocol |
| 2 | `Project_Boundaries.mdc` | What NOT to do |
| 3 | `PRD.mdc` | What to build |
| 4 | `KPI.mdc` | How to measure success |

### Phase 2: Design (Read before architecture decisions)
| Order | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 5 | `features/features.mdc` | Detailed user stories |
| 6 | `persona/frontend_persona.mdc` | Frontend tech decisions |
| 7 | `persona/backend_persona.mdc` | Backend tech decisions |
| 8 | `persona/database_persona.mdc` | Database tech decisions |

### Phase 3: Architect (Read before implementation)
| Order | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 9 | `extended/architecture.mdc` | System architecture |
| 10 | `extended/ERD.mdc` | Database schema |
| 11 | `extended/security.mdc` | Security rules |
| 12 | `extended/error_handling.mdc` | Error states + state machine |
| 13 | `extended/style-guide.mdc` | UI design system |

### Phase 4: Implement (Read during development)
| Order | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 14 | `Project_Scope.mdc` | Scope constraints |
| 15 | `extended/deployment.mdc` | Hosting + env setup |
| 16 | `extended/.env.example` | Required environment vars |

### Phase 5: Verify (Read during testing)
| Order | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 17 | `extended/testing.mdc` | Test strategy + commands |
| 18 | `extended/observability.mdc` | Logging + monitoring |

