## 4. Conflict Resolution Priority

When files contradict each other, follow this priority (highest to lowest):

1. **Project_Boundaries.mdc** — Absolute rules, never override
2. **Security.mdc** — Security requirements override convenience
3. **PRD.mdc** — Business requirements are source of truth
4. **KPI.mdc** — Success criteria validate PRD
5. **Architecture.mdc** — Technical decisions follow PRD
6. **ERD.mdc** — Data model follows architecture
7. **Style-guide.mdc** — UI follows architecture + personas
8. **Features.mdc** — Stories implement PRD requirements

